; coverage for modal.kurt's "diamond-distrib-or" and "K" axioms -- never exercised by any proof
; file before this one (box-distrib-and and T already have worked examples in this directory).
load modal
bool p, q

; diamond distributes over or, restated generically both directions
(◇p ∨ ◇q) ≡ ◇(p ∨ q)   "diamond-distrib-or restated"

; K distribution: if it's necessary that p implies q, then necessity of p gives necessity of q
use □(p ⇒ q) "box-implication"
use □p "box-p"
□p ⇒ □q
□q
